From 2322764548b49fc7e6adfa0efcfcc0cf852c7829 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(guest): settle Multi-User via linger and stable init

Stop racing getty session scopes with a mkdir'd XDG runtime on 16 KiB
boots: linger user@1000, order wawona-session after the user runtime,
and bound session restarts. Prioritize udev coldplug for block/tty/net.
Seed system-1-link + /init so cmdline uses init=/init across generations.
---
